{"id":"3e052fdd1e781abd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeTable.md","title":"PolyTypeTable","display":"PolyTypeTable","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTypeTable","parameters":["D","ap","V"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTypeTable"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>ap</span><span>V</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>ap</code>、<code>V</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTypeTable D ap V)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ TotalApplication D ap)\n  (and\n    (forall q\n      (implies\n        (in q V)\n        (exists d\n          (exists rho\n            (exists a\n              (exists R\n                (and\n                  (exists z2273 (and (exists z2274 (and (@ Pair a R z2274) (@ Pair rho z2274 z2273))) (@ Pair d z2273 q)))\n                  (@ PolySemanticInput D d rho a R))))))))\n    (forall d\n      (forall rho\n        (forall a\n          (forall R\n            (implies\n              (@ PolySemanticInput D d rho a R)\n              (iff\n                (exists z2275\n                  (and\n                    (exists z2276\n                      (and (exists z2277 (and (@ Pair a R z2277) (@ Pair rho z2277 z2276))) (@ Pair d z2276 z2275)))\n                    (in z2275 V)))\n                (or\n                  (exists n (and (@ FTV n a) (@ App rho n R)))\n                  (or\n                    (exists b\n                      (exists c\n                        (exists B\n                          (exists C\n                            (and\n                            (@ TArr b c a)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2264\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2265\n                            (and (exists z2266 (and (@ Pair b B z2266) (@ Pair rho z2266 z2265))) (@ Pair d z2265 z2264)))\n                            (in z2264 V)))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2267\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2268\n                            (and (exists z2269 (and (@ Pair c C z2269) (@ Pair rho z2269 z2268))) (@ Pair d z2268 z2267)))\n                            (in z2267 V)))\n                            (@ PERArrow D ap B C R))))))))\n                    (exists b\n                      (exists dd\n                        (exists P\n                          (and\n                            (@ FForall b a)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Succ d dd)\n                            (and\n                            (@ PERSpace D P)\n                            (forall x\n                            (implies\n                            (in x D)\n                            (forall y\n                            (implies\n                            (in y D)\n                            (iff\n                            (@ Edge R x y)\n                            (forall H\n                            (implies\n                            (in H P)\n                            (exists rr\n                            (exists Q\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons H rho rr)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2270\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2271\n                            (and (exists z2272 (and (@ Pair b Q z2272) (@ Pair rr z2272 z2271))) (@ Pair dd z2271 z2270)))\n                            (in z2270 V)))\n                            (@ Edge Q x y))))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b4002d1847fb33d0\" href=\"?note=b4002d1847fb33d0\" title=\"ZFC_FForall\">FForall</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fc187922d1b1881\" href=\"?note=5fc187922d1b1881\" title=\"ZFC_FTV\">FTV</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fbb658acd5de4a50\" href=\"?note=fbb658acd5de4a50\" title=\"ZFC_PERArrow\">PERArrow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b398cfc0d4c41817\" href=\"?note=b398cfc0d4c41817\" title=\"ZFC_PERSpace\">PERSpace</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1ef25f2aaccc6b2e\" href=\"?note=1ef25f2aaccc6b2e\" title=\"ZFC_PolySemanticInput\">PolySemanticInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"583417dddb133841\" href=\"?note=583417dddb133841\" title=\"ZFC_TotalApplication\">TotalApplication</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note